PROJECT: VYAPARO

Build a Complete, Premium, Production-Ready Business Management SaaS Platform

Act as a senior SaaS architect, senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, security engineer, and product manager.

Build a complete, modern, premium, responsive business management platform named Vyaparo.

This must be a functional application, not merely a landing page, UI prototype, static dashboard, or collection of non-working buttons.

The platform should help small businesses in India manage billing, sales, expenses, customer records, udhaar (credit), inventory, profit and loss, payment reminders, and business analytics from one place.

The application must be designed for deployment using GitHub and Vercel.

Build the application in a maintainable, modular architecture with secure authentication, a persistent database, server-side validation, and a scalable subscription system.

Do not claim that a feature is functional until its implementation is complete and tested.

